COMPILATION OF: E49F2

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E49F2

   1 a 0000 E49F2:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-49/P3] ordered relation `> ' with UNEQUAL extents
   4 a 0006      (char(3) vs char(2)).  If accepted with immediates, [C334]'s
   5 a 0006      positional law predicts B = LEFT extent 3, A = RIGHT extent 2;
   6 a 0006      min/max/keyed readings are the falsifiers -- the same
   7 a 0006      discriminators E49B3/B4 killed for =, re-tested here because
   8 a 0006      no transfer may be assumed. */
   9 c 0006   dcl
  10 c 0006     1 rec,
  11 c 0006       2 na char(3),
  12 c 0006       2 nb char(3),
  13 c 0006       2 s2 char(2);
  14 c 0006   dcl k fixed bin(15);
  15 c 0006   if rec.na > rec.s2 then k = 1;
  16 c 001E   put list('K=', k);
  17 c 0040   stop;
  18 a 0043 end E49F2;

CODE SIZE = 0043
DATA AREA = 000C
FREE SYMS = 3888
END  COMPILATION
